EIP-2612 Permit Security
The integration of the EIP-2612 standard allows users to interact with CryptoTengo Hub decentralized applications without requiring a preliminary approve transaction.
Users sign structured off-chain message data (EIP712Domain) using their private keys, while the interface or router submits the signature directly to the contract. This mechanism reduces gas expenses by up to 50% and significantly lowers entry barriers for retail holders.
